(Validation 14, pass 1 [F4 T6f WU1]: the Professional validation_14 without
 the local refinement and control_repeat, i.e. the first pass only. Drucker-
 Prager plate with a hole, tria3 mesh after control_mesh_split. Targets =
 Professional 02-08-2026 node_dof at the hole nodes 4 and 120. The tria3
 nodal recovery is the arithmetic mean of the adjacent elements [Pro];
 GNU before the fix was area-weighted: node 4 sigyy -11.23 vs -8.5195,
 eppyy -3.91e-3 vs -2.247e-3, node 120 sigyy -7.06 vs -2.772. After the fix
 GNU = Pro within 1e-4 relative [plastic iteration noise]; tolerance 1e-3.)

echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_strain_plasti
materi_stress
end_initia

node 1  0.00 0.00
node 2  0.02 0.00
node 3  0.04 0.00
node 4  0.00 0.02
node 5  0.02 0.02
node 6  0.04 0.02
